# Markdown docs
*.md
!/README.md
!/docs/*.md
!/docs/proposals/*.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/.planning/**/*.md
!/src/main/prompt-builder/**/*.md
# Bundled Agent Skills ship their SKILL.md / README.md as source of truth.
# The Pi skills loader rejects entries whose frontmatter `name` diverges from
# the parent directory; losing SKILL.md to the blanket *.md ignore meant a
# fresh checkout silently dropped every skill from the catalogue.
!/builtin-skills/**/*.md
*.zip
*.blockmap
*.exe

